# The proof of a cycle claim (hard_claims/cycle_claim, the cycle claims of
# certificate_cycles and easy_terms): a Scott sum of two constructors, in
# order: proved, whose one field is the argument's name, and conjecture,
# whose one field is the conjecture's class. Read by its position
# (gezi.contest.corpora.claims.Proof).
λ export
. export
  (λargument proved conjecture. proved argument) λclass proved conjecture. conjecture class
